  "description": "FileExplorer field type for Dignite.Abp.FlexFields - lets a flex field reference one or more files picked through Dignite.FileExplorer. A bolt-on, not a built-in: referencing this package pulls in only Dignite.Abp.FlexFields.Abstractions, never Dignite.FileExplorer itself - the Angular half (@dignite/ng.flex-fields-file-explorer) is what actually talks to FileExplorer's API, so a host wires both together, but neither module references the other.",
